  user_1,Yeah, it said something about 'transaction failed' and then... I just closed it.
  user_2,Got it. Sometimes the bank blocks it. Let me... um... send you a fresh link, okay?
  user_1,Sure, please. Also, can you confirm the policy status? The portal still shows 'Expired'.
  user_2,Right now, because the payment hasn't cleared, the system still flags it as expired. Once the payment posts, it'll change to 'Active' automatically.
  user_1,[sighs] I really need the car covered; I'm going on a trip next week.
  user_2,Understood. I'll expedite this. I'll send a new secure link to your email and also a WhatsApp copy. You should get it in a minute.
  user_1,Thanks. I'll try now.
  user_2,Great. Let me know if anything else comes up. And just so you know, once the payment is confirmed, your policy number AU‑45219 will show renewal till 04/10/2027.
  user_1,Okay, will do. Thanks for the help.